dre.lore.carcinus=The sea falls silent... but the world has felt your strength. Glacons and Frosts roam the snow, sharks and whales rise from the deep, Wildfires and hell spiders blaze in the Nether.
dre.lore.snow_glacon=The frost retreats. The snow globe breathes of Iceika - and somewhere out there, on the Frozen Throne, someone is waiting for you.
dre.lore.lich_king=The Lich King has fallen, and his cold has released what was sleeping. Evil awakens everywhere: in deserts, jungles, caves and the Nether. The throne shards remember something ancient.
dre.lore.ancient_entity=The Ancient Entity crumbles to dust, but its gaze remains. Eyes open in the End: the Ender Watchers have sensed you. Their gaze is the key to the Watcher.
dre.lore.watcher=The Watcher has closed its eye forever. The Eye pulls somewhere beyond: the way to Arcana sleeps within it.
dre.lore.king_of_scorchers=The King of Scorchers is extinguished. Blue fire cools in your hands, and the Nether is quieter than it has been in ages.
