dre.nightmare.enter=You are dreaming. Here everything is reversed: foreign weapons heal, foreign armor hurts, foreign food starves. Trust only the things of Vethea.
dre.nightmare.weapon=In the nightmare a foreign weapon heals instead of wounding.
dre.nightmare.armor=Foreign armor does not protect in the dream - it draws the blows.
dre.nightmare.food=Foreign food only teased your hunger in the dream.
dre.nightmare.potion=A potion from the waking world turned against you in the dream.
dre.nightmare.tool=A foreign tool sticks in the dream stone.
dre.nightmare.flight=You cannot fly in the dream without Dream Wings.
dre.nightmare.slab=The foundation of the floor does not yield. Only rifts lead up - look for fire crystals.
dre.nightmare.rift_place=The rift does not tolerate building.
dre.vethea.downdraft=The nightmare flow throws you down. You need Dream Wings of tier %s.
dre.vethea.guard=The nightmare does not let you onto this floor. You need Dream Wings of tier %s.
dre.vethea.gift_marked=The dream remembered: %s. A gift awaits you when you wake up.
dre.vethea.gift=You woke up, and beside you lies a dream gift: %s.
